      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The split trades exact evaluation against cancellation: below the cutoff the arithmetic structure is expanded, while above it only bounded partial sums and decreasing weights are needed. Choosing z balances the errors, so the proof depends on an interface between local summation and global cancellation rather than on termwise control everywhere.",
